%N A399106 Irregular triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the conductor of chi_{n,A038566(n,k)}, where chi_{n,m} is the Dirichlet character modulo n with label m in the Conrey labeling system, and A038566(n,k) is the k-th number coprime to n.
%C A399106 A400532 is the main version.
%H A399106 Jianing Song, <a href="/A399106/b399106.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10060</a> (rows n = 1..181)
%H A399106 LMFDB, <a href="https://www.lmfdb.org/Character/Dirichlet/Labels">Dirichlet character labels</a>.
%F A399106 T(n,k) = A400532(n,A038566(n,k)) for 1 <= k <= EulerPhi(n).
